s fluids, as well as operation of retail fueling and vehicle wash establishment. The company's Imaging & Identification segment provides precision marking and coding, product traceability equipment, brand protection, and digital textile printing equipment and solution, as well as consumable, software, and service to packaged and consumer goods, pharmaceutical, industrial manufacturing, textile, and other end-market. Its Pumps & Process Solutions segment manufactures specialty pump, connector, flow meter, fluid connecting solution, plastics and polymer processing equipment, and engineered components for rotating and reciprocating machines. The company's Climate & Sustainability Technologies segment manufactures refrigeration system, refrigeration display case, commercial glass refrigerator and freezer door, and brazed plate heat exchanger for industrial heating and cooling, and residential climate control applications. Dover Corporation was incorporated in 1947 and is headquartered in Downers Grove, Illinois.","employees":24000,"website":"https://www.dovercorporation.com","country":"United States","city":"Downers Grove","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Richard Joseph Tobin","title":"President, CEO & Chairman of the Board"},{"name":"Mr. Christopher B. Woenker","title":"Senior VP & CFO"},{"name":"Ms. Ivonne M. Cabrera","title":"Senior VP, General Counsel & Secretary"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":18.04,"tpe":25.65,"ps":2.129,"pfcf":27.29,"peg":1.42,"pb":3.604,"ev_ebitda":14.61,"rev_growth":0.119,"eps_growth":0.1745,"eps_growth_fwd":0.156,"eps_growth_next":0.1437,"div_yield":0.007,"roe":0.1435,"roa":0.05694,"de":67.83,"gross_margin":0.319,"op_margin":0.1176,"profit_margin":0.0714,"current_ratio":1.724},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":17.77,"sector":18.04,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":24.49,"sector":25.65,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":3.257,"sector":2.129,"verdict":"Overvalued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"